        <Desc>HOUSING:THE ORGANIZATION OPERATES FIVE SOBER LIVING PROPERTIES. GOALS ARE TO FOSTER PERSONAL RESPONSIBILITY, RESTORE SELF-ESTEEM AND SELF-CONFIDENCE, AND ELIMINATE ISOLATION BY CREATING A COMMUNITY ATMOSPHERE WITH THE ULTIMATE GOAL OF STAYING CLEAN AND SOBER WHILE TRANSITIONING TO INDEPENDENT LIVING.</Desc>
